{"overview":"در آسام، ۱۴ سالهٔ آپو در جستجوی بی‌امان برای نجات سگ محبوبش، مومو، پس از ربودن او، به سفر می‌پردازد. در حالی که در بیهار، سگ وفادار به نام اسکار، در مسیر خطرناکی برای پیدا کردن صاحب ربوده‌شده‌اش، کودک کارگری ۱۵ ساله، حرکت می‌کند. در حین سفرهایشان، واضح می‌شود که دو ربودن ممکن است به طرحی بزرگتر و شیطانی مرتبط باشند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In Assam, 14-year-old Apu embarks on a desperate quest to rescue his beloved dog, Momo, after he is kidnapped. Elsewhere, in Bihar, a devoted dog named Oscar sets out on a perilous journey to find his kidnapped owner, a 15-year-old child labourer. As their journeys unfold, it becomes clear that the two kidnappings may be connected to a larger, sinister plan.","tagline_en":"","runtime":150,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Amit Rai"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"Maahi Rai","role":"Apu","photo":""},{"name":"Pankaj Tripathi","role":"Masterji","photo":"/f3Vxz0QB7PHeyPcXrfJX14Xkxnu.jpg"},{"name":"Pavan Malhotra","role":"Akaljeet Sodhi","photo":"/aqTzRvGsujDgxoLbVEvVEZVTyNr.jpg"},{"name":"गीता अग्रवाल शर्मा","role":"Apu's Mother","photo":"/5Jrwb9zWG2Hjmf8PQLuDmCKnMHG.jpg","en":"Geeta Agrawal Sharma"},{"name":"Rajesh Kumar","role":"Daroga","photo":"/vat8qbqIeumutuToGX0VrtA06M6.jpg"},{"name":"Shreedhar Dubey","role":"Mukadam","photo":""},{"name":"Jitendra Joshi","role":"Rajale","photo":"/rUtSbkJXDwk3jmLiO0Zt8oNgIMO.jpg"},{"name":"Bullu Kumar","role":"Lalua - Goon 1","photo":""},{"name":"Sulakshana Baruah","role":"Krishna","photo":""},{"name":"Prashant Kashyap","role":"Apu's Father","photo":""},{"name":"Shashie Verma","role":"Police Inspector Mumbai","photo":"","en":"Shashie Vermaa"},{"name":"Vijay Mishra","role":"SHO Mohd. Yusuf Hazari","photo":""}],"trailer":"Hkv1-F5-EaI","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1727563/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatr